  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Chung Eui-sun (Korean: 정의선; born 18 October 1970), anglicized as Euisun Chung, is a South Korean billionaire business executive. He is the executive chairman of Hyundai Motor Group and executive chairman and one of three chief executive officers of Hyundai Motor Company, and the only son and \"heir apparent\" of Hyundai Motor Group honorary chairman Chung Mong-koo.\nHe is among the richest people in South Korea. In August 2026, Forbes estimated his net worth as US$5.8 billion and ranked him 9th richest in the country.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
  },
